OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with some patchy
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain this turning heavier
OL,7,Fduring the afternoon and evening.
OL,8,FSoutherly winds freshening too.
OL,9,FPerhaps brighter for the Solway coast
OL,10,Ffor a time during the day and feeling
OL,11,Fmild in the far west.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain continuing for most
OL,14,Fareas during the evening, perhaps East
OL,15,FLothian seeing some drier spells and
OL,16,Frain clearing from the east by dawn.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FCloudy but drier day for
OL,19,Fmost, the Lothian and Borders coast
OL,20,Fperhaps seeing some afternoon showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
